data/raw
data/build
data/merged/*
!data/merged/data.yaml
!data/merged/SOURCES.md
vision-data-env
.DS_Store
*.cache
__pycache__
/*.zip
data/*.zip
.venv
data
# The bare "data" rule above (added via a merge, not authored in this
# session) matches any directory literally named "data" at any depth -- it
# was meant for the top-level ./data (already covered explicitly by the
# data/raw, data/build, data/merged/* lines above anyway), but it also
# silently swallowed crew_datasets/data/, which is a real, wanted dataset
# (crew_a/crew_b images+labels+manifests), not scratch data. Un-ignore it
# explicitly rather than removing the teammate's line outright.
!crew_datasets/data/
!crew_datasets/data/**
.vscode
.claude
.obsidian
.env
